{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rumbly is a fast-paced roguelike that rewards precision, rhythm, and instinct. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm, reflex, and instinct are your greatest weapons. Time your attacks, master enemy patterns, and unleash the power of a true feathery fighter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/8d582f5c2b2c6464a16a9fb5e732ad27.avif?t=1773942238\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras_big/8d582f5c2b2c6464a16a9fb5e732ad27.avif?t=1773942238 width=800 height=122 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster and more precisely you act, the more <strong>devastating your combos</strong> become. Every turn is a chance to prove your reflexes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the right buttons to attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your attacks for <strong>extra damage and fever bonus</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fever Mode</strong> boosts your damage and pauses the countdown timer!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/18e39b144035dcf757e43f16e344f3ea.poster.avif?t=1773942238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/18e39b144035dcf757e43f16e344f3ea.webm?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/18e39b144035dcf757e43f16e344f3ea.mp4?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/685d32268ffb2778225fe41767afe3f3.poster.avif?t=1773942238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/685d32268ffb2778225fe41767afe3f3.webm?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/685d32268ffb2778225fe41767afe3f3.mp4?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Path</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful <strong>Elite enemies</strong> to earn greater rewards.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grants <strong>two Blessings instead of one</strong>, allowing you to build stronger synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > choosing the Elite path will make future enemies <strong>more ferocious</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you play it safe, or risk it all for greater power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/2d0751a6e93ba5415da324276bacdafc.poster.avif?t=1773942238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/2d0751a6e93ba5415da324276bacdafc.webm?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/2d0751a6e93ba5415da324276bacdafc.mp4?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/83cc7fb2f4922dcc6954a29144cb6e1c.avif?t=1773942238\" width=616 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read enemy patterns, dodge in rhythm, and adapt your tactics. Each enemy attacks differently \u2014 and expects you to keep up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills to dodge the attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied attack patterns keep battles exciting!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/7c9b113cddcbb8870711ca2cd6531c8f.poster.avif?t=1773942238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/7c9b113cddcbb8870711ca2cd6531c8f.webm?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/7c9b113cddcbb8870711ca2cd6531c8f.mp4?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/d7ef2e9b5d7ee3c91c43dc0b10227a51.poster.avif?t=1773942238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/d7ef2e9b5d7ee3c91c43dc0b10227a51.webm?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/d7ef2e9b5d7ee3c91c43dc0b10227a51.mp4?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/f36e406279b9b5d35ed038213886e5d0.avif?t=1773942238\" width=616 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock flashy, high-impact skills and combine them with <strong>Blessings</strong> that change the rules of battle each run. Build powerful synergies or gamble on chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every milestone floor, you'll receive a <strong>Blessing Buff</strong> that makes you stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Blessing buff comes with its own set condition bonus, allowing you to customize your build freely.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike progression ensures a dynamic and  replay experience!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/9bffc5db9c18ba3212b327ec564b2e64.poster.avif?t=1773942238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/9bffc5db9c18ba3212b327ec564b2e64.webm?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/9bffc5db9c18ba3212b327ec564b2e64.mp4?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/feb5dc62033848ad50e9020e307440e6.poster.avif?t=1773942238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/feb5dc62033848ad50e9020e307440e6.webm?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/feb5dc62033848ad50e9020e307440e6.mp4?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/c838aefe4e059af14897c1a2e6ecb551.avif?t=1773942238\" width=616 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use earned currency to unlock permanent upgrades, new characters, or skills. Your climb gets better every time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new characters and skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items are unlocked\u00a0by meeting special conditions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/68a3451953dd7c16edaed2ca9cd7f368.poster.avif?t=1773942238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/68a3451953dd7c16edaed2ca9cd7f368.webm?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/68a3451953dd7c16edaed2ca9cd7f368.mp4?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tight battles, satisfying progression, and cute-but-deadly bird warriors \u2014 <i>Rumbly</i> will keep you flapping \u2018til sunrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612210?t=1773942238","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/9c4cc1ac931d4222c02173db6c049605d0814eeb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773942238","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/6f966b06b2c32fb2fafb422f49781dfa769d6062/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773942238","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/6f966b06b2c32fb2fafb422f49781dfa769d6062/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773942238","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descr