10/extras/c838aefe4e059af14897c1a2e6ecb551.avif?t=1773942238\" width=616 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use earned currency to unlock permanent upgrades, new characters, or skills. Your climb gets better every time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new characters and skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items are unlocked\u00a0by meeting special conditions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/68a3451953dd7c16edaed2ca9cd7f368.poster.avif?t=1773942238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/68a3451953dd7c16edaed2ca9cd7f368.webm?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/68a3451953dd7c16edaed2ca9cd7f368.mp4?t=1773942238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tight battles, satisfying progression, and cute-but-deadly bird warriors \u2014 <i>Rumbly</i> will keep you flapping \u2018til sunrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SeedGameStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/d6352e61698291f94e32413ff34f828113aa3ab1/header.jpg?t=1773942238","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Rumbly \u00a9 2025 Seed Game Studio. All Rights Reserved.<br />\r\nRumbly and its related logos, artwork, and content are the property of Seed Game Studio. Unauthorized reproduction, distribution, or modification of this game is strictly prohibited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.s